WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.242
A favourite quantum conjecture falls.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.536
Pass a state through this noisy channel twice.

3
00:00:05.536 --> 00:00:07.930
The conjecture said all entanglement is gone.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.218
It held in small dimensions; this explicit

5
00:00:11.218 --> 00:00:13.291
channel on twenty-one levels breaks it.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.696
Claimed: entanglement survives two passes.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.779
Lean checks part.
